---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---
<DocsLayout title="Environment variable reference">
  <h1>Environment Variables (.env)</h1>
  <p>Canonical reference for backend and frontend env keys currently used by the codebase.</p>

  <h2>Backend: core required</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><code>DB_TYPE</code>, <code>DB_HOST</code>, <code>DB_PORT</code>, <code>DB_USER</code>, <code>DB_PASS</code>, <code>DB_NAME</code></li>
    <li><code>REDIS_URL</code></li>
    <li><code>PORT</code></li>
    <li><code>JWT_SECRET</code>, <code>PQ_JWT_SEED</code></li>
    <li><code>NODE_ENCRYPTION_KEY</code>, <code>NODE_PQ_ENCRYPTION_SEED</code></li>
    <li><code>FRONTEND_URL</code>, <code>PANEL_URL</code>, <code>BACKEND_URL</code></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Backend: auth and origin</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><code>ORIGIN</code> — passkey/WebAuthn expected origin</li>
    <li><code>RP_ID</code> — passkey/WebAuthn relying-party ID</li>
    <li><code>JWT_COOKIE_NAME</code>, <code>JWT_COOKIE_DOMAIN</code>, <code>JWT_COOKIE_SECURE</code>, <code>JWT_COOKIE_MAX_AGE</code></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Backend: mail and mailbox</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><code>SMTP_HOST</code>, <code>SMTP_PORT</code>, <code>SMTP_USER</code>, <code>SMTP_PASS</code>, <code>SMTP_SECURE</code>, <code>SMTP_FROM</code></li>
    <li><code>MAILBOX_DOMAIN</code>, <code>MAIL_DOMAIN</code>, <code>MAILBOX_INBOUND_SECRET</code></li>
    <li><code>MAILCOW_API_URL</code>, <code>MAILCOW_API_KEY</code>, <code>MAILCOW_API_SECRET</code></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Backend: provider integrations</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><code>CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN</code>, <code>CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID</code>, <code>CLOUDFLARE_BASE_ZONE</code>, <code>CLOUDFLARE_CREATE_SUBZONE</code></li>
    <li><code>PDNS_BASE_URL</code>, <code>PDNS_API_KEY</code></li>
    <li><code>WINGS_ALLOW_INVALID_CERT</code></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Backend: abuse and SOC</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><code>ANTIABUSE_AI_ENABLED</code>, <code>ABUSE_REPORT_EMAIL</code></li>
    <li><code>SOC_ABUSEIPDB_API_KEY</code>, <code>SOC_ALERT_EMAIL</code>, <code>SOC_ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL</code>, <code>SOC_ALERT_EMAIL_SEVERITIES</code></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Frontend: commonly used</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><code>BACKEND_URL</code></li>
    <li><code>NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE</code></li>
    <li><code>NEXT_PUBLIC_WINGS_BASE</code></li>
    <li><code>NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL</code></li>
    <li><code>NEXT_PUBLIC_COMMIT_SHA</code>, <code>NEXT_PUBLIC_REPO_URL</code></li>
    <li><code>NEXT_PUBLIC_HACKCLUB_STUDENT_ENABLED</code>, <code>NEXT_PUBLIC_GITHUB_STUDENT_ENABLED</code></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Important notes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Do not rotate <code>PQ_JWT_SEED</code> or <code>JWT_SECRET</code> unintentionally, or active sessions break.</li>
    <li>Keep <code>NODE_ENCRYPTION_KEY</code> and <code>NODE_PQ_ENCRYPTION_SEED</code> stable across restarts.</li>
    <li>For production, keep secrets outside version control and use secret managers or environment-injected values.</li>
  </ul>
</DocsLayout>
